  "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_primate_comparison",
  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Comparing Black People to Primates",
  "description": "This is a well-documented racial stereotype that has been used historically and in popular culture to demean Black people by associating them with animals, particularly primates. The meme uses the image of a frog (a reptile often associated with primates in racist caricatures) to visually represent the slur 'niggers', which is a racial epithet targeting Black people. This stereotype is rooted in racist pseudoscience and dehumanization.",
